Additionally, all figures and factual statements produced by our product Atelier are grounded in sources and can be retrieved for audit purposes, ensuring explainability and audibility a posteriori. Our data protection measures include configurable retention aligned with legal archival obligations, role-based access control, and audit logging of access and system outputs. A Data Protection Officer is also appointed to oversee these processes.
